{{also|Appendix:Variations of "ot"}}
==Russian==

===Prefix===
'''от-''', {{lang|ru|[[ото-]]}} (ot-, oto-)

# {{context|used with verbs|lang=ru}} [[away]] [[from]]
#:* {{l|ru|идти́}} — ''to go''
#:* {{lang|ru|[[отойти]] [[от]]}} — ''to go away from''

====Usage notes====
* Only use от- when the subject first was in the extreme vicinity of something and then moves away from it, still remaining within a sight range.
: ''Я отошла от неё.''
::I walked away from her. (I probably took only a few steps away from her, still being able to see her in the same room or space.)
: ''Я {{lang|ru|[[уйти|ушла]]}} от неё.''
::I walked away from her. (I left her where she was and went to a different place.)

